@startuml
hide footbox
participant "Fred" as p1
participant "Barney" as p2
p1 -> p2 : Please
' e1 note: Fred is asking Barney for his bowling ball nicely.
' e1 comment: Fred: &#34;Please&#34;
note right of p2 : Gives bowling ball
